sequenceDiagram
  actor A as Equipe de ambulância
  participant G as API Gateway
  participant P as Patient Registry
  participant H as Pre-Hospital
  participant T as Telemetry
  participant M as MQTT Broker
  participant K as Kafka
  participant C as Clinical Query
  participant J as Patient Journey

  A->>G: identificar/criar Patient
  G->>P: Patient conhecido ou provisório
  A->>G: iniciar encounter + ETA
  G->>H: PreHospitalEncounter
  A->>G: iniciar sessão / associar dispositivos
  G->>T: TelemetrySession + DeviceAssignment

  loop telemetria antes da chegada
    A->>M: publish device telemetry
    M->>T: MQTT QoS 1
    T-->>K: aggregate/anomaly/observation events
    K-->>C: atualizar ClinicalPatientView
  end

  A->>G: atualizar ETA/risco
  G->>H: atualização pré-hospitalar
  H-->>K: pre-arrival events
  A->>G: registrar chegada
  G->>H: ARRIVED
  H-->>J: continuidade da jornada clínica
